---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import RoverTrail from '~/components/RoverTrail.astro';
const tagline = 'Senior Software Engineer @ BSH · 25+ years · Writing on AI × developer productivity.';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="About — marsmike.com"
  description={tagline}
  siblingPath="/about/"
  shell="wide"
>
  <article class="page-stack">
    <div class="console-strip">
      <span>◆ Crew Dossier · ID-04</span>
      <span>STATUS · VERIFIED</span>
      <span>BASE · REGENSBURG</span>
    </div>
    <section class="dossier-layout">
      <div class="surface-card surface-card--muted">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Crew Dossier</div>
        <h1 class="font-[var(--font-display)] text-5xl leading-none tracking-[-0.04em] text-[var(--color-text)] mb-4">
          Mike Müller
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-[var(--color-muted)] max-w-[38rem] leading-relaxed">
          Senior Software Engineer @ BSH, 25+ years in software, writing on AI × developer productivity.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-6 text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed max-w-[42rem]">
          Twenty-five years writing software. Started with Smalltalk and classic OOP.
          These days the work is about making people, tools, and agents collaborate reliably.
          MarsMike is half brand name, half operating condition: thin air, plenty of dust, and delivery still needs to land.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <RoverTrail lang="en" compact={true} />
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="status-stack">
        <figure class="surface-card p-3">
          <img
            src="/images/marsmike-profile.png"
            alt="Mike Müller in a Mars suit against a Mars landscape"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover rounded-[1.1rem] border border-[var(--color-border)]"
          />
          <figcaption class="mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            MarsMike as a portrait motif.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <section class="surface-card">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Surface Conditions</div>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">Regensburg · BSH · delivery pipeline reality, not demo theater.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="surface-card">
          <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Open signal for</div>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">Mentorship, agent reliability discussion, late-career engineering questions, and serious recruiter outreach.</p>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="section-head section-head--stack">
      <div class="section-head__index">04</div>
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow mb-2">Dossier · Who is transmitting</div>
        <h2 class="font-[var(--font-display)] text-4xl tracking-[-0.04em] text-[var(--color-text)]">Who is transmitting.</h2>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="surface-card">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Mission</div>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">
          Senior Software Engineer in BSH's RAISE-SW GenAI team, building production AI agents inside the software delivery pipeline.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface-card">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Governance</div>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">
          Elected works council representative at BSH, involved in how AI rollouts actually land in a 60,000-person company.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="surface-card">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-3">Radar segments</div>
        <div class="tag-cluster">
          <span class="tag-pill">Architecture</span>
          <span class="tag-pill">Knowledge Management</span>
          <span class="tag-pill">CI/CD</span>
          <span class="tag-pill">Background Agents</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,0.8fr)]">
      <div class="surface-card">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">What lives here</div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--color-text)] leading-relaxed">
          <p>What I think about: software delivery in the GenAI era, end to end. Requirements, architecture, knowledge management, CI/CD, background agents — the daily friction, not the keynote-talk version.</p>
          <p>I write about it here as field reports from real practice: what survives contact with production, what breaks under load, and which patterns are actually worth keeping.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="surface-card">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Signal paths</div>
        <ul class="space-y-3 list-none pl-0 text-[var(--color-text)]">
          <li><a href="mailto:mike@marsmike.com" class="button-link no-underline">mike@marsmike.com</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marsmike" class="button-link no-underline">LinkedIn ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/marsmike" class="button-link no-underline">GitHub ↗</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://x.com/marsmike" class="button-link no-underline">X (@MarsMike) ↗</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
